<http://data.silknow.org/object/1709c6dd-0b2c-399f-8352-1a89858e9467/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress fabric of woven silk, twill binding.\nIncomplete pattern of stripes.\n[1] part of a pink ground stripe with an isolated floral motif: a flowering plant with dark grey petals edged in white with grey leaves edged with yellow as is the stem.\n[2] narrow stripe with a white ground and a gentle dark grey meander bearing pink leaves and buds.\n[3] A wide stripe with a dark grey band on which is a series of two narrow serrated leaves in pink edged in yellow forming an approximate V-shape.  Between and above each leaf pair are small rosettes or buds in pink edged in white with yellow details.\nWarp: pink, white and dark grey silk.\nWeft: pink and yellow silk, both Z-twist; white silk, S-twist and dark grey silk, indeterminable twist.\nThere is one selvedge, 0.5 cm wide with white, pink and yellow warp threads.\nType possibly as the Hussain Kuli Khan."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/1709c6dd-0b2c-399f-8352-1a89858e9467> .

<http://data.silknow.org/vam>
        ecrm:P106_is_composed_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/9eaeb39d-bfa0-3dea-b812-9cc42abcbc1a> .

